 "こたつでぬくぬくしているにゃんぷっぷーをお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@punyan/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4da5178/uploads/origins/73cbf439-37ff-4211-bc4b-64e978220016?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8cde2b2f3525320455b39936d0c3660", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f4da5178/uploads/origins/73cbf439-37ff-4211-bc4b-64e978220016?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8cde2b2f3525320455b39936d0c3660, https://si.imgix.net/f4da5178/uploads/origins/73cbf439-37ff-4211-bc4b-64e978220016?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=833bcd2fcf62d92686fccfcc9903657f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f4da5178/uploads/origins/73cbf439-37ff-4211-bc4b-64e978220016?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c1de07c31038a4d008dbbbf5b6a8156 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！これを元に何か描いてもらえませんか？よろしければにゃんぷっぷーにすることもできます。\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/dcdh3t.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@punyan/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/10b423ed/uploads/origins/b08b1a5a-0177-4a9a-a3b9-324531310dbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67dad402b0706541b13c10ee158166d9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/10b423ed/uploads/origins/b08b1a5a-0177-4a9a-a3b9-324531310dbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67dad402b0706541b13c10ee158166d9, https://si.imgix.net/10b423ed/uploads/origins/b08b1a5a-0177-4a9a-a3b9-324531310dbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a66faa730f9d10413d7401f9cb83b0b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/10b423ed/uploads/origins/b08b1a5a-0177-4a9a-a3b9-324531310dbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f5d0e8778b8afd558514d33e77c0596 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "防寒具をつけて暖かそうなにゃんぷっぷーのイラスト